Z||000000||jlruiz67||07-12-2000||10:07 PM||||TORNADO AIR MANAGEMENT SYSTEM  <BR> <BR>MORE POWER, BETTER MILEAGE WITH THE TORNADO AIR MANAGEMENT SYSTEM!<P>Tornado! What exactly is it? Lots of questions, right? Well, it is an air-TWISTER, patented worldwide, with 10 years of research & development behind it; the TORNADO is an automotive air channeling tool that creates a swirling air motion, allowing the air to move faster and more efficiently by continuously whirling air around corners and bends - imagine a mini-tornado on its side moving through the intakes of your automobile. It causes better fuel atomization, resulting in an increase of gas mileage anywhere from 7-24%. These figures are confirmed by road testing performed at an emission lab licensed by the EPA. Dyno testing shows 4-13 added H.P. as well! The TORNADO is easy to install; 2-5 minutes usually, requires no maintenance and is an affordable addition to most passengers cars, light trucks and RVs on the road.<P>Available for virtually all cars, trucks and suvs. <BR> <BR>TORKXX<BR>Internet Special : $ 74.95  <BR>Super Sale Price : $ 64.95  <A HREF="http://www.tornadoair.com/what_is_it_.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.tornadoair.com/what_is_it_.htm</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.autoaccessory.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.autoaccessory.com/</A> <P>*******Has anyone seen this before? Does anyone have any idea on wether they are fool of it? If this works, its not a bad price vs performance. Well I hope you find this interesting.<P><BR>[This message has been edited by jlruiz67 (edited 07-12-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by jlruiz67 (edited 07-12-2000).]||||reg||1
